-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">▶출품자격</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">다른 공모전에 출품·수상 내역&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">또는 활용 이력이 없는 순수 창작물</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">※위 내용 위반 시, 수상 취소 및 상금 회수 및&nbsp; 민·형사상 조치 진행</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">▶심사기준</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">- 정부부처, 청년유관기관 등의 기존 슬로건과 유사하지 않을 것</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">- 단순 명료한 메시지로 누구나 쉽게 기억하고 응용가능할 것</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">- 정치색이 지나치게 드러나거나 정치적으로 편향적이지 않을 것</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">- 특정분야와 무관하게 청년 관련 정책에 광범위하게 활용할 수 있을 것</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">▶유의사항</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">- 표절, 저작권, 명예훼손 등 분쟁에 따른 모든 문제는 응모자가 책임지며, 입상 후 관련 사항이 확인될 경우 수상 취소 및 시상금, 민·형사상 조치를 취할 수 있습니다.</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">- 우수작으로 선정된 슬로건과 내용이 동일한 슬로건이 있는 경우, 먼저 접수된 슬로건을 시상합니다.</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">- 심사결과 동급에 해당하는 작품이 없을 경우 선정하지 않을 수 있으며, 참여자 수 및 공모작 수준에 따라 시상내용이 달라질 수 있습니다.</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">- 채택된 슬로건의 저작권은 주최처에 귀속됩니다.</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">- 수상작은 청년정책 SNS 홍보 콘텐츠로 활용될 수 있습니다.</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">▶문의</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">청년정책 공식 이메일</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\"><font face=\"나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif\">we_are_youth@naver.com</font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 13.3333px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;; vertical-align: baseline; min-height: 20px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: 나눔고딕, &quot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;\">＊원문:</span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;\">&nbsp;</span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://blog.naver.com/we_are_youth/222897284141\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"font: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(75, 75, 75);\">https://blog.naver.com/we_are_youth/222897284141</a>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
